  "solution": {
    "text": "X is in f.c.c. lattice<br />Number of atoms <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Total tetrahedral voids <math><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />As y are at T.V.<br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Number of Octahedra voids <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Hence the formula of solid is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> or <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math> .",
